<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of soccer matches played</p>
<p>in the German league championship on Saturday:</p>
<p> Bayern Munich		  1 Werder Bremen	   0</p>
<p> Arminia Bielefeld	    1 Karlsruhe		 2</p>
<p> Bayer Leverkusen	     2 Schalke		   0</p>
<p> Hansa Rostock		  3 Freiburg		  1</p>
<p> Borussia Moenchengladbach  2 Fortuna Duesseldorf   0</p>
<p>Played on Thursay:</p>
<p> Duisburg			 1 Hamburg		   1</p>
<p> St Pauli			 0 Borussia Dortmund     1</p>
<p> VfB Stuttgart		  1 1860 Munich	     1</p>
<p> Bochum			   2 Cologne		   2</p>
